  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="11">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 11</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="11" corresp="#wit-q">Et nemo socnam habeat super tainum regis nisi solus rex.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="11" corresp="#wit-h">⁊ nan man náge náne socne ofer cynges þegen buton cyng sylf.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="11" corresp="#wit-h">⁊ nan man náge náne socne ofer cynges þegen buton cyng sylf.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-h">And no-one shall have jurisdiction over a thegn of the king except the king himself.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und über einen Königsthegn habe niemand als der König selbst irgend eine Gerichtsbarkeit.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And let no one have any jurisdiction over a king's thegn except the king himself.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares I Atr 1.14.</note>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
